  "id": "active-listening",
  "term": "active listening",
  "definition": "Active listening is a communication skill in which a person shows careful attention and interest to a speaker through responsive, empathic verbal and nonverbal behavior. It commonly involves asking fitting questions and restating or briefly summarizing what the speaker has said to support understanding and a warm, accepting relationship.",
